No, you get both. The intrinsics system differentiates between
intrinsics gained from corpses, and 'extrinsic' intrinsics gained from
things like rings. Since fire and cold resistance are normally so
easily gained through corpse eating, the rings and armour which convey
the 'extrinsic' intrinsic are not usually worth bothering with. With
this patch, a =oFR may become an AK item for some classes.

